      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-09-05T15:33:51Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On general OO principles I think you should have\n\nstruct ServiceVm { vm_instance: VmInstance }\n\nAnd then make this an impl on ServiceVm.\n\n(Every ServiceVm has a VmInstance, but not ever VmInstance is a ServiceVm.)\n\nAnd the Drop of ServiceVm should do the shutdown if it hasn\u0027t already happened.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 63,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 63,
        "endChar": 64
      },
      "revId": "63990c0ecb245d41431925257733d295f87e7917",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "2da85974_a4c658ee",
        "filename": "virtualizationservice/src/service_vm.rs",
        "patchSetId": 2
      },
      "lineNbr": 67,
